 ### On-the-Fly SfM
-Traditional SfM frameworks (e.g., COLMAP) are incapable of processing images in an online manner. On-the-Fly SfM employs a Hierarchical Weighted Local Bundle Adjustment (BA), in which only neighboring connected and registered images are incorporated into BA after acquiring a new image, significantly reducing time complexity compared to global BA [S5]. It achieves online feature matching via global feature retrieval on HNSW (Hierarchical Navigable Small World) to enable efficient dynamic updates for the matching matrix [S5].
